# Merge only missing blocks, or replace the existing block for that hostname.
# Do not load this alongside duplicate blocks from the older reference files.
# Preserve the edge's global TLS, Cloudflare trust and unrelated site settings.
# Requires the edge's existing utilibre_no_transform, utilibre_proxy_headers,
